---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Terms of Service | Ekwly</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/ekwly/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-page text-main antialiased selection:bg-primary-light selection:text-primary min-h-screen py-10 px-4 md:px-8">
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-surface border border-border rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm">
      <div class="mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-border flex items-center justify-between">
        <a
          href="/ekwly/"
          class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors">
          ← Return to App
        </a>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-widest">Legal</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-main mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Effective Date: October 5, 2026</p>

      <section class="space-y-6 text-sm text-main/90 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            By creating an account, launching a room, joining a session, or using the Ekwly web or
            native mobile clients, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">2. Financial Calculation Disclaimer</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Ekwly is strictly an informational mathematical engine and ledger coordination utility.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-muted mt-2">
            <li>
              Ekwly is not a bank, non-banking financial company (NBFC), payment aggregator, payment
              gateway, or certified tax consultancy.
            </li>
            <li>
              While the math engine accounts for tax splits, service charges, discounts, and
              round-offs, you and your group members remain solely responsible for validating
              restaurant figures and local tax compliance.
            </li>
            <li>
              We disclaim liability for any financial discrepancy, miscalculation, interpersonal
              payment disagreement, or incorrect input.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">3. Peer-to-Peer Settlements</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Settlement functions that invoke UPI deep links (`upi://pay`) delegate the transaction
            execution entirely to external payment applications (e.g., Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm,
            or BHIM) and banking networks. Ekwly does not hold, escrow, process, or mediate funds
            transferred between users.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">4. User Conduct & Abuse</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Users may not reverse engineer the application, abuse Gemini API endpoints, deploy
            automated extraction bots, or attempt to bypass security policies enforced on the
            backend database. Accounts found violating operational boundaries are subject to
            immediate termination.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">5. Jurisdiction</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            These terms are governed by and construed under the laws of India. Any disputes arising
            in connection with the platform shall fall under the jurisdiction of competent courts in
            India.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
